s{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seancorfield/honeysql/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seancorfield/honeysql/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seancorfield/honeysql/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seancorfield/honeysql/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seancorfield/honeysql/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seancorfield/honeysql/deployments","created_at":"2012-07-13T13:58:26Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T05:55:30Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-11T14:47:47Z","git_url":"git://github.com/seancorfield/honeysql.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:seancorfield/honeysql.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/seancorfield/honeysql.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/seancorfield/honeysql","homepage":"https://cljdoc.org/d/com.github.seancorfield/honeysql/CURRENT","size":1968,"stargazers_count":1861,"watchers_count":1861,"language":"Clojure","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":173,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":2,"license":null,"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":173,"open_issues":2,"watchers":1861,"default_branch":"develop","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"```\n(deftest test-honeysql-union\n  (is (= [\"SELECT x FROM (SELECT x FROM abc UNION SELECT x FROM def) foo\"]\n         (sql/format {:select ['x]\n                      :from (list [{:union (list\n                                             {:select ['x]\n                                              :from [:abc]}\n                                             {:select ['x]\n                                              :from [:def]})}\n                                   :foo])}))))\n```\n\nfails: instead, honeysql produces\n\n```\nSELECT x FROM ((SELECT x FROM abc) UNION (SELECT x FROM def)) foo\n```\n\nThis doesn't work with sqlite, and some opinions are that this is invalid SQL (though it works with MySQL) — I haven't read the standard myself.\n\nSee this bite others:\n\nhttp://stackoverflow.com/questions/4653124/what-does-the-sql-standard-say-about-parentheses-in-sql-union-except-intersect-s#4653180\nhttps://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/issues/9790\nhttps://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/issues/8053\nhttps://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/pull/8054\n\nThe only reason to parenthesize, AFAICT, is to avoid ambiguity when ordering and limiting one of the inner queries. (See #138/#140.)\n\nBut it utterly breaks SQLite, so I think that has priority!\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seancorfield/honeysql/issues/141/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seancorfield/honeysql/issues/141/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]